  "title": "Kansas City Style &#34;Burnt Ends&#34; Philly Cheesesteak",
  "description": "A twist on a Philly Cheesesteak featuring Kansas City style &#34;burnt ends&#34; barbecue and traditional cheesesteak toppings like sauteed onions, pickled peppers and cheese whiz.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
